  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "At the moment screenspace UIs on Android flatscreen work, but the equivalent setup on desktop flatscreen does not. (The exact behaviour on desktop is that the screenspace canvas only works whilst looking at the worldspace that the canvas occupies.\n\nPlease don't make us have to maintain three different input modes when creating cross-platform prefabs/worlds - please make screenspace UI work on desktop as well.\n\nThis would have the added benefit of supporting people who game on touch-enabled Windows devices. Who I am sure, 100%, definitely exist.",
